  "summary": "Adds test spenders for legacy script edge cases to the `feature_taproot` functional test. The added cases cover CSV with -2, a 5-byte operand whose value fits in 1 byte, IFDUP on negative or non-minimal zero, ROLL with duplicate values, and OP_16 inside a P2SH scriptSig.",
  "problem": "Current test vectors do not explicitly exercise these script edge cases, and because existing fuzz coverage already hits the relevant branches, the fuzz minimizer drops them. This leaves gaps where regression tests or script assets do not test behaviors known to have tripped up alternate implementations.",
